nt} reads the statement; Section~\\ref{sec:beyond}","+draws the line between it and the manuscript;","+Sections~\\ref{sec:proof} and \\ref{sec:replay} inspect and replay the","+proof; Section~\\ref{sec:consequences} says what follows;","+Section~\\ref{sec:practitioner} is for the practitioner;","+Section~\\ref{sec:lean} is our own Lean; Section~\\ref{sec:related} is","+related work; Section~\\ref{sec:conclusion} concludes and lists the","+questions this reading left for its author to decide. Every section","+ends with a list headed ``what this does not claim''. Appendix~\\ref{app:lean}","+lists every Lean name the paper cites; Appendix~\\ref{app:tech} holds the","+technical detail, the definitions with their line numbers, the theorem","+with its quantifiers, the spine of the proof, behind the plain text of","+the body. The OpenAI repository is read throughout at one commit,","+\\texttt{4eaee875}, as untrusted data: with text tools only, never built","+or run in place; the one build is the sandboxed replay.","+","+\\subsection{What this does not claim}","+\\label{sec:intro-not}","+","+\\begin{itemize}","+\\item \\textbf{Nothing beyond the sections it summarises.} Every","+  sentence of this introduction is a sentence of a later section said","+  shorter; where the two differ, the later section, with its file and","+  line, is the one that counts.","+\\item \\textbf{Nothing about the result's importance.} Whether the","+  refutation matters is not a question this paper asks; what the","+  verified statement says, and at what sizes, is.","+\\item \\textbf{No prior-art claim.} ``We found no earlier statement'' of","+  the title's observation is bounded to the six texts","+  Section~\\ref{sec:related} names; the literature at large was not","+  searched.","+\\end{itemize}"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/home/al/dev/MOSP/paper3/latex/sec1_intro.tex"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01NPHYWrYDxvNoXhK1G2mBJ6","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"con